{"id":"bcb01615ace90acb","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_ArInductionRaw.md","title":"ArInductionRaw","display":"ArInductionRaw","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"ArInductionRaw","parameters":["out"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"ArInductionRaw"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>out</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：对象理论公理代码。有序参数：<code>out</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ ArInductionRaw out)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists phi\n  (exists vx\n    (exists tz\n      (exists ts\n        (exists basecase\n          (exists stepcase\n            (and\n              (@ ArFm phi)\n              (and\n                (@ Nat vx)\n                (and\n                  (exists z4639\n                    (exists z4640\n                      (exists z4641\n                        (and (@ Num0 z4639) (and (@ Num0 z4641) (and (@ Seq z4640 z4641) (@ FFun z4639 z4640 tz)))))))\n                  (and\n                    (exists z4642\n                      (exists z4643\n                        (exists z4644\n                          (exists z4645\n                            (exists z4646\n                            (and\n                            (@ Num1 z4642)\n                            (and\n                            (@ Num1 z4644)\n                            (and\n                            (@ Seq z4643 z4644)\n                            (and\n                            (exists z4647 (and (= vx z4647) (@ FVar z4647 z4645)))\n                            (and (@ Num0 z4646) (and (@ App z4643 z4646 z4645) (@ FFun z4642 z4643 ts))))))))))))\n                    (and\n                      (@ ArSub vx tz phi basecase)\n                      (and\n                        (@ ArSub vx ts phi stepcase)\n                        (exists z4648\n                          (exists z4649\n                            (and\n                            (exists z4650\n                            (and\n                            (exists z4651\n                            (exists z4652\n                            (and\n                            (= basecase z4651)\n                            (and\n                            (exists z4653\n                            (and\n                            (exists z4654\n                            (exists z4655\n                            (and\n                            (= vx z4654)\n                            (and\n                            (exists z4656 (exists z4657 (and (= phi z4656) (and (= stepcase z4657) (@ PImp z4656 z4657 z4655)))))\n                            (@ FAll z4654 z4655 z4653)))))\n                            (@ PNeg z4653 z4652)))\n                            (@ PImp z4651 z4652 z4650)))))\n                            (@ PNeg z4650 z4648)))\n                            (and\n                            (exists z4658 (exists z4659 (and (= vx z4658) (and (= phi z4659) (@ FAll z4658 z4659 z4649)))))\n                            (@ PImp z4648 z4649 out)))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e893c21f12508dd6\" href=\"?note=e893c21f12508dd6\" title=\"ZFC_ArFm\">ArFm</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4179267aa71bb7d2\" href=\"?note=4179267aa71bb7d2\" title=\"ZFC_ArSub\">ArSub